include ../_partials/camcore.pug

+camcoreEmail('CAMCORE MEDIA • REQUESTS', event, heading)
  +camcoreGreeting(recipientName, recipientEmail, applicationTitle)
  p(style='margin: 14px 0 0; color: #435562; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px;')
    | #{body}

  +camcorePanel('Email channel')
    div(style='color: #071827; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; font-weight: 750;') Cameron-Media Requests can successfully deliver email notifications to this mailbox.
    div(style='margin-top: 6px; color: #526572; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;')
      | Expected sender identity: Requests | CamCore Media <help@camcore.au>

  +camcoreButton(applicationUrl, 'Open Cameron-Media Requests')
